{"id":"H5988","lemma":"עַמִּיאֵל","transliteration":"ammiel","sayIt":"am-mi-EL","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Ammiel","meaning":"A man living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, only mentioned at Num.13.12;\nson of: Gemalli (H1582)\n§ Ammiel = \"my kinsman is God\"\n1) the spy from the tribe of Dan who perished in the plague for his evil report\n2) father of Machir of Lo-debar\n3) father of Bathsheba; also 'Eliam'\n4) the 6th son of Obed-edom and doorkeeper of the temple","glosses":["ammiel"],"count":6,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"num-13","v":12,"renderings":{"bsb":"Ammiel","kjv":"Ammiel"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-9","v":4,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Ammiel","kjv":"of Ammiel"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-9","v":5,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Ammiel","kjv":"of Ammiel"}},{"chapterId":"2sa-17","v":27,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Ammiel","kjv":"of Ammiel"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-3","v":5,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Ammiel","kjv":"of Ammiel"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-26","v":5,"renderings":{"bsb":"Ammiel","kjv":"Ammiel"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"Numbers 13:12","note":"Of the tribe of Dan, Ammiel the son of Gemalli.","source":"web"},{"ref":"2 Samuel 9:4","note":"The king said to him, “Where is he?” Ziba said to the king, “Behold, he is in the house of Machir the son of Ammiel, in Lo Debar.”","source":"web"},{"ref":"1 Chronicles 3:5","note":"and these were born to him in Jerusalem: Shimea, Shobab, Nathan, and Solomon, four, of Bathshua the daughter of Ammiel;","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H0463","lemma":"אֱלִיעָם","transliteration":"eliam","gloss":"Eliam"},{"id":"H1582","lemma":"גְּמַלִּי","transliteration":"gemalli","gloss":"Gemalli"},{"id":"H3075","lemma":"יְהוֹזָבָד","transliteration":"yehozavad","gloss":"Jehozabad"},{"id":"H3098","lemma":"יוֹאָח","transliteration":"yoach","gloss":"Joah"},{"id":"H3485","lemma":"יִשָּׂשכָר","transliteration":"yissaskhar","gloss":"Issachar"},{"id":"H4353","lemma":"מָכִיר","transliteration":"makhir","gloss":"Machir"},{"id":"H5417","lemma":"נְתַנְאֵל","translit